WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.208
A guard walked through Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:22.881
"Lights out," she called. "It's bedtime!"

3
00:00:22.882 --> 00:00:27.718
In his cell Mr. Presto grumbled and climbed into bed.

4
00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:32.998
Mrs. Wiggles and Dr. Odd were in nearby cells.

5
00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:36.930
"I hate bedtime!" Mrs. Wiggles said.

6
00:00:36.931 --> 00:00:40.136
The guard ignored the villain.

7
00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:43.482
She walked around a corner.

8
00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:45.661
Then she gasped.

9
00:00:45.662 --> 00:00:48.015
There was a huge hole in the wall.

10
00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:55.764
The guard shouted. "A prisoner escaped!"

11
00:00:55.765 --> 00:00:58.609
"Where's Terrell?" Jack asked.

12
00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:01.655
Roxy and Mara were waiting outside Jack's house.

13
00:01:01.656 --> 00:01:04.666
"He's going to be a little late today," Roxy said.

14
00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:10.140
"We can walk to school without him."

15
00:01:10.141 --> 00:01:13.295
The three friends walked along the sidewalk.

16
00:01:13.296 --> 00:01:16.395
"Why is Terrell going to be late?" Jack asked.

17
00:01:16.396 --> 00:01:23.038
Mara chuckled. "He's probably at home, trying to figure out who Rocket Girl really is!"

18
00:01:23.039 --> 00:01:25.745
Jack laughed.

19
00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:30.746
Roxy grinned. "No, he's at a dentist appointment."

20
00:01:30.747 --> 00:01:33.357
Soon they arrived at school.

21
00:01:33.358 --> 00:01:37.167
As they reached their classroom, Roxy heard her watch beep.

22
00:01:37.168 --> 00:01:39.312
"I'll be right in," Roxy said.

23
00:01:39.313 --> 00:01:44.672
"I have to, um, use the restroom."

24
00:01:44.673 --> 00:01:47.237
Roxy ducked around a corner.

25
00:01:47.238 --> 00:01:49.458
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered.

26
00:01:49.459 --> 00:01:51.475
"Is everything okay?"

27
00:01:51.476 --> 00:01:53.627
The mayor looked confused.

28
00:01:53.628 --> 00:01:55.742
"I'm not sure, Rocket Girl.

29
00:01:55.743 --> 00:01:59.201
I think someone escaped from Metro City Prison."

30
00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:01.666
"Who?" Roxy asked.

31
00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:04.165
"I don't know," Mayor Bloom said.

32
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:07.002
"The guards spent the night checking cells.

33
00:02:07.003 --> 00:02:09.779
All the prisoners are still there."

34
00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.808
Roxy scratched her head.

35
00:02:11.809 --> 00:02:13.619
"I don't understand, Mayor.

36
00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.070
Why do you think someone escaped?"

37
00:02:16.071 --> 00:02:19.566
"There's a big hole in the prison wall," Mayor Bloom said.

38
00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.834
"It's very suspicious."

39
00:02:21.835 --> 00:02:24.183
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

40
00:02:24.184 --> 00:02:26.233
"I'm on my way."

41
00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:30.937
Suddenly the school doors flew open.

42
00:02:30.938 --> 00:02:35.215
Shwoom! A loud humming sound filled the air.

43
00:02:35.216 --> 00:02:37.355
Roxy closed her watch.

44
00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:40.325
She felt an invisible force pulling on her.

45
00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:45.330
Teachers and students flew by, as if a vacuum was pulling them.

46
00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:49.585
Using her super strength, Roxy kept her feet planted on the floor.

47
00:02:49.586 --> 00:02:51.682
Mara and Jack flew by.

48
00:02:51.683 --> 00:02:55.152
"Ahh!" Mara screamed.

49
00:02:55.153 --> 00:02:57.396
"Help!" Jack shouted.

50
00:02:57.397 --> 00:03:01.071
Books, pencils, and papers dropped from backpacks.

51
00:03:01.072 --> 00:03:03.191
The hallway was a mess.

52
00:03:03.192 --> 00:03:07.732
A moment later everyone was gone.

53
00:03:07.733 --> 00:03:12.025
"Yikes!" Roxy thought. "What's going on?"

54
00:03:12.026 --> 00:03:15.618
"Huh?" Terrell said. "What happened?"

55
00:03:15.619 --> 00:03:18.681
He was standing in front of Metro City Elementary School.

56
00:03:18.682 --> 00:03:20.795
Papers and books lay on the blacktop.

57
00:03:20.796 --> 00:03:23.242
The doors were wide open.

58
00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:26.634
Terrell ran inside.

59
00:03:26.635 --> 00:03:30.946
At the far end of the hallway, he saw Roxy dart into a restroom.

60
00:03:30.947 --> 00:03:33.023
Terrell hurried down the hallway.

61
00:03:33.024 --> 00:03:44.012
A second later the restroom door banged open, and Rocket Girl burst out!
